      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should be extremely cautious about combining St. John's Wort with hormonal birth control. This combination can cause St. John's Wort to interfere with how your body metabolizes the hormones, potentially making your birth control less effective. For your safety, it is crucial that you discuss this interaction with your prescribing doctor or pharmacist before taking anything. They can advise you on safe alternatives that won't compromise your contraception.",
