      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Even though it's an herb, St. John's Wort is a powerful substance that interacts significantly with prescription medications. It is not safe to assume it's harmless, especially when interacting with hormonal birth control. Because this interaction can severely affect the effectiveness of your contraception, you should absolutely not start taking it today without professional medical guidance. Please prioritize your safety and consult a healthcare provider before combining these substances.",
      "source": "target",
