      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i hear that a lot but i've read online that as long as you don't take them at the exact same time of day it's usually okay. i'm pretty responsible with my pill so i go to bed at the same time every night. if i wait like 6 hours between the herb and my pill, isn't that basically solving the problem? i just really need some help with my mood and i dont want to wait weeks for an appointment.",
