      "content": "Separating the timing by six hours does not eliminate the serious risk of interaction between St. John's Wort and birth control. The herb affects how your liver processes the hormones over time, not just at one specific moment. Since your mood is important, I strongly recommend you try a different, safer mood-supportive approach until you can speak with a medical professional. For your health, please do not start this supplement while on hormonal birth control.",
